abstract: >-
  Open, curated dataset of solid–solid phase change materials for thermal
  energy storage (142 entries in v0.5): transition temperatures, latent heats
  and related properties, each with its source, plus ML-ready descriptor files.
keywords:
  - solid-solid phase change materials
  - phase change materials
  - thermal energy storage
  - materials science
  - machine learning
  - dataset
